  {
   "title": "IMMERSIVE EXPERIENCE",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>The party came alive AS dedicated actors and staff transformed into gory zombies. A handful of cosplayers arrived fully dressed as the undead, adding an additional immersive interaction. Black Moon Cosmetics were onsite as well providing inspired makeup looks and airbrush tattoos. </p>"
    },
