  {
   "title": "PHOTO MOMENTS",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>A branded step-and-repeat welcomed guests, providing the first photo moment after check-in. In the courtyard, guests encountered a custom FANGORIA photo opp featuring Marvel Zombies, recreating the iconic magazine cover for playful UGC shots. Guests also posed at Thor’s Throne, perfectly framed by the fireplace, a branded stained-glass logo, and dramatic lighting.</p>"
