  {
   "title": "SCREENING",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Guests grabbed popcorn topped with “bloody” butter before heading into the theater for the main event, introduced by Director Bryan Andrews and Marvel Television head, Brad Winderbaum. Simultaneously, an outdoor courtyard screening took place, with zombified staff roaming the space to keep the immersive experience alive.</p>"
